00:36:53.770 --> 00:37:00.713
Right. Because at the end of the day, like, you know, if the government wants to seize

00:37:00.713 --> 00:37:02.458
BlackRock's assets, they're going to do it.

00:37:02.458 --> 00:37:06.660
It doesn't really matter if it's in Zcash or it's in Bitcoin.

00:37:06.660 --> 00:37:10.328
So maybe that's what solves this problem for Zcash.

00:37:10.328 --> 00:37:15.390
Zcash in that way can be much more of like a grassroots movement,

00:37:15.390 --> 00:37:24.364
much more decentralized, individualized, and sort of, yeah, sort of much more underdog,

00:37:24.364 --> 00:37:25.636
much more cypherpunk.

00:37:25.636 --> 00:37:29.119
Yeah, that makes sense. Well, yeah, that was it.

00:37:29.119 --> 00:37:30.292
Thank you for your time.

